{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "9d7d49224dc79b53e34be2badd177bf3e747df89915ba6c8f928ead1167558ce", "ja": "走り出した可能性", "zh": "奔跑起来的可能性", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b6949131a5b5403ca7110ebb092317b96d52e2a0731da64c6442f25775f9b66e", "ja": "『竜宮小町』のデビューライブは大盛況に\n終わり、反響への対応に追われるながらも\n充実している様子の律子。何より嬉しいのは\nプロデューサーと並んで歩けるところ、と\n微笑むのだった。", "zh": "『龙宫小町』的出道演唱会圆满落幕，律子虽然忙于应对热烈反响，却也显得十分充实。最让她开心的，还是能和制作人并肩走在一起。她微笑着说道。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "933a8e1fa86d3e622a0869be88a0d4849b6da087593a0a5e80ddbfbd724af34e", "ja": "（『竜宮小町』のデビューライブは大盛況！\nそれぞれの個性が躍動する、出色の完成度だった）", "zh": "（“龙宫小町”的出道演唱会大获成功！每个人的个性都充分展现出来了，完成度实在出色）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_07_1001_011ami", "source_sha256": "201268b70fbd66631b186208870a88692cf46d3071d148a47e1e1cd02b23239d", "ja": "ほら、見て見ていおりん！\n亜美たちめーっちゃバズってるよ！　えっと～。", "zh": "你看你看，伊织！  \n亚美她们超火的哦！那个～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_07_1002_011ami", "source_sha256": "c826a860d29455c1e86c7818930507957c06027a530d331f8ac6175b12725244", "ja": "アツカンのステージとか、フレッシュでキャッチーで\nコケティッチュ、とか！　つまりどういう意味？", "zh": "像热酒舞台之类的，清新又抓人，\n还很俏皮什么的！到底是什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_07_1003_007ior", "source_sha256": "e3304a52285b2925c57e43f46021ac5e0bc4c334417c4d85d657c3c6a75fae82", "ja": "つまり、評判がいいってこと！\nはぁ、才能がありすぎて困っちゃうわ♪", "zh": "总之，就是评价很高的意思！\n唉，才华太出众了，也真让人伤脑筋呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_07_1004_010azu", "source_sha256": "9b6a5e5d918f6564726adcab77375bfe21ccaed00c8e27ae4aa367287ead8d03", "ja": "オファーもたくさん届いてるんですって♪\n律子さんも対応で忙しそうですね。", "zh": "听说还收到了很多邀约呢♪\n律子小姐好像也忙着处理这些事呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_07_1005_p", "source_sha256": "21482dd8776aacc40f0afcfbae616fa1b92dd9bbdc4505a36f237adcb8b2f496", "ja": "リリース直後は、どうしても立て込みますからね。\nできる限り、フォローはしているんですけど……", "zh": "刚发布后，事情难免会集中到一起。\n我也在尽可能帮忙处理，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_07_1006_011ami", "source_sha256": "1b10d234178ffcce510e06214c3b5faf6f913da83e7c417b98a25af44b8f202e", "ja": "律っちゃん、またレッスンさぼるのー？\nズルっこはいけませんな～。", "zh": "律子，你又要翘掉练习吗～？\n偷懒可不行哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_07_1007_009rit", "source_sha256": "2f24d84ad4307c440aa0fcdef77fcf63058651c1888b3d5d2a4537a2f5deb8c3", "ja": "サボってないわよ、失礼ね。\n亜美だけレッスン倍にしましょうか？", "zh": "我才没有偷懒呢，真没礼貌。\n要不要只让亚美的训练量加倍？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_07_1008_011ami", "source_sha256": "60545fe1ed1005974773182bdff594c52e0f52032d3c8b6d83f756925516ef43", "ja": "あうあう、お茶目に絡んだだけなのに～！\nひどい仕打ちだよ、オーボーだよボーボーだよ！", "zh": "呜呜，只是调皮地逗了一下嘛～！\n太过分了，这是蛮横，这是大大蛮横啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_07_1009_007ior", "source_sha256": "9cefcd738452cd9f41047dcc1c7099b2a6326913d41f96c4f08428a0270d6bcd", "ja": "お疲れさま、律子。一段落したの？", "zh": "辛苦了，律子。忙完一阵了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_07_1010_009rit", "source_sha256": "985843b1220685f3bfe266e9a19d4d76cc56a986849b6aadc4a8cb8fa68cccf0", "ja": "とりあえずはね。\nこの後のレッスンは、一緒にできそうよ。", "zh": "暂时算是吧。\n接下来的训练应该能一起进行了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_07_1011_010azu", "source_sha256": "218b9016011d5f9142b066b496f8f0f6923d570fbffbc98bf05f5c849d28e8df", "ja": "よかった♪　でも、無理はしないでくださいね？\n私も、なにかお手伝いできればいいんだけど。", "zh": "太好了♪不过，请不要勉强自己哦？\n我也想帮上点什么就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_07_1012_p", "source_sha256": "c947f482e2aaeeb4b039b6815cee78b63f9effb4a6d9cccaec96082c7e9fd628", "ja": "オファーの仕分けとか、振ってくれてもいいんだぞ？\n音無さんや青羽さんも、何でも言ってくれって。", "zh": "委托的分配之类的，也可以交给我来做哦？\n音无小姐和青羽小姐也尽管吩咐，有什么事都可以告诉我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_07_1013_009rit", "source_sha256": "2a0d8fc3e76da94d57937c82b935465d8e8ed401611593ca70a2fbeee271061c", "ja": "お気遣いありがとうございます。でも、できるだけ\n自分でやりたいんですよね。なにしろ……。", "zh": "谢谢你的关心。不过，我还是想尽可能\n自己来做。毕竟……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_07_1014_009rit", "source_sha256": "2a8fa6e7dee5f59faacd00e31b55f9f401ff793b3752d25a7cd2e6cfd663d6fa", "ja": "私の……。\n私達の、竜宮小町だから。", "zh": "我的……\n我们的龙宫小町。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_07_1015_007ior", "source_sha256": "2120947dd9955a90fe33ffe41becf34a62692ae87b85ef40c52316cdc0cdea33", "ja": "……ふふっ。", "zh": "……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_07_1016_010azu", "source_sha256": "2120947dd9955a90fe33ffe41becf34a62692ae87b85ef40c52316cdc0cdea33", "ja": "……ふふっ。", "zh": "……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_07_1017_011ami", "source_sha256": "2120947dd9955a90fe33ffe41becf34a62692ae87b85ef40c52316cdc0cdea33", "ja": "……ふふっ。", "zh": "……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_07_1018_009rit", "source_sha256": "2011861b1ad643b5fff9c9c25438a0b65ec8d34c6b5cd9b9a6e315085683a5b1", "ja": "というわけで、どこまでいけるか分かりませんけど。\nやれるとこまで、やってみようと思います！", "zh": "所以，虽然不知道自己能走到哪一步，\n但我想先尽力试试看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_07_1019_p", "source_sha256": "e254421c61bf8afb4883f1dd2116344c7ba5eea9cc0d9d8c00f5b92d6035bb1a", "ja": "いいと思うよ。\nあとは、やってみてから考えよう！", "zh": "我觉得挺好的。\n剩下的，就等试过了再去考虑吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_07_1020_009rit", "source_sha256": "ba501dca966d76295f17bdfe849ea1f58aed5a28da0ff49ed7d2dff04505cd76", "ja": "あら、ポジティブな姿勢。\nでも……、そうですね！", "zh": "哎呀，态度很积极嘛。\n不过……确实如此！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_07_1021_009rit", "source_sha256": "60768f84b6bcab3463298b7cad73da561d811ef16caa3efcc45773f4bee18690", "ja": "とはいえ、私はちょいちょい抜けると思うから、\nその時は3人で。……よろしくお願いね、リーダー。", "zh": "不过，我觉得自己可能会时不时缺席，所以那时候就3个人吧。……拜托你了，队长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_07_1022_007ior", "source_sha256": "37c776ef06d5f1cc866922e8d0b102ff21a3775ce3881a130175e6a94d621b5c", "ja": "そっちこそ。おいしい仕事をしっかり取ってきなさい♪\nそれじゃ、そろそろレッスンに行きましょ！", "zh": "你才是。好好把那些美差给我拿回来哦♪\n那么，我们也差不多该去上课了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_07_1023_011ami", "source_sha256": "f8f5965154ae3e1921a6594730a8a1f06a2996a25452afe7d1ca74bd5dffb9e6", "ja": "ラジャー了解！　4人でやるの久しぶりだね！\nあ、亜美新作のモノマネがあるんだ～♪", "zh": "收到，明白！好久没和4个人一起做了呢！\n啊，亚美还有个新学的模仿哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_07_1024_010azu", "source_sha256": "7ecb618640285e834f14ba8ac6e4f3a020abfa7ae7ac15d20aafffe9c3d06012", "ja": "亜美ちゃん、モノマネ大会はあとにしましょうね。\nでないと、また叱られるわよ～。うふふ♪", "zh": "亚美，模仿大会留到以后吧。  \n不然又要挨骂了哦～呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_07_1025_009rit", "source_sha256": "fd6ecda707c2ee7f3b3154f1e4825488c5f1c543e503d1436613edb409dd8286", "ja": "……あ、そうだ。{$P$}、\n今回のこと、本当にありがとうございました。", "zh": "……啊，对了。{$P$}，这次的事情真的非常感谢您。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_07_1026_p", "source_sha256": "95ce53aed9858dc00a6d755bd8e1e34dd874a8f362f6e849929bb752836c9916", "ja": "ん？　どうしたんだ、改まって。", "zh": "嗯？怎么了，突然这么郑重其事的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_07_1027_009rit", "source_sha256": "7f8607f02e7e7af3d9bc918ec94ee89816c31a4112eb41a9ebafa2d05cae849a", "ja": "お礼です。そういえば、まだ言ってなかったなって。\nおかげさまで、毎日充実してるもんですから。", "zh": "是来道谢的。说起来，我还没好好说过呢。  \n多亏了你，我每天都过得很充实。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_07_1028_009rit", "source_sha256": "6213bc7a9e88000b77b00c5e63489bebd109e8accb5aff88aa8c366418425424", "ja": "やっぱりいいものですね、プロデューサーって。", "zh": "制作人，果然是个很不错的职业呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_07_1029_p", "source_sha256": "ef8dd708479e9d4fefa4ec9b2bdd75203ada2bb104d56c948f0a36e6873c9154", "ja": "それはよかった。\n例えば、どういうところが？", "zh": "那就好。\n比如说，具体是哪些方面？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_07_1030_009rit", "source_sha256": "5b90d7af4815472bf379f58e20485447eb1756bc3e78063096205dfb212e4e33", "ja": "そうですね。いろいろあるんですけど……。\nじゃあ一つだけ言いましょうか。", "zh": "是啊，有很多呢……。\n那就说一个吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_07_1031_009rit", "source_sha256": "92d345183cd05f76416719f0ccadae4dce8561129e0bcb5979479878daa5bbe9", "ja": "貴方と、肩を並べて歩けるところ！\n……ふふっ！", "zh": "能和你并肩走在一起的地方！……呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
